        "assignment": "For fixed integer anchors, combine the deep-denominator quadratic-residue obstruction with the parametrized common-neighbor equations and the six cross-neighbor square conditions. Seek a structural consequence valid for all heights; preserve zero square roots and exclude zero or repeated elements.",
